    {
        "chunk_id": 3,
        "content": "## Table of content\nIn-depth familiarization with the content of this manual, assembly, start-up and operation of the air handling unit in line with the instructions provided and following all safety regulations will ensure the basis of efficient, safe and non-failure operation of the device. This operation and maintenance manual does not cover all possible variants of the unit's configurations, examples of their assembly and installation as well as start-up, operating, repairing and maintenance. If the units are used for what they are intended, this documentation and any other materials provided with the unit contain information designed for the qualified technical personnel only.",
        "metadata": {
            "source": "testing2.md",
            "section": "Table of content",
            "position": 3
        }
